# state/ policy: operational records that must SURVIVE container recycling are
# tracked (this is a private repo — suppression and run status are compliance
# records); bulky regenerable intermediates are not.
state/*
!state/README.md
!state/suppression.json
!state/niche_scores.json
!state/niche.json
!state/last_run_status.json
!state/sam_request_ledger.json
!state/qc-log.md
!state/briefs
!state/outreach
__pycache__/
*.pyc
